        {
          "id": "d13-s8",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "8. Outlook",
          "heading": 2,
          "style": "h2",
          "tocEntry": "8. Outlook",
          "tocLevel": 2,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 121.5
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d13-s8-outlook",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Looking ahead to Q4 2025, management expects modest sequential growth with flat headcount. Capital expenditure for Q4 2025 is budgeted at $17.2M, the majority allocated to office consolidation.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 135.9
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d13-s8-p11",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Operational KPIs are refreshed weekly on the internal dashboard; this document is the quarterly point-in-time snapshot.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 160
          },
